{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作りたい作りたい作りたい作りたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ハンドメイド意欲湧いてきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか作ろう←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうなのそうなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親友がね、\nプリンシパル大阪公演の前に\n(研修旅行終わりに)\n渡す予定だったらしいのですが、\nすっかり忘れてたらしく、\n公演終わりに学校でもらったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブローチもらったんです。\n手作りの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのブローチに\nちっちゃい紙が挟んであるんです。\nおまもりって書いてあるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場で泣いてしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう親友ちゃんよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのブローチは\n私服に付けられたらなあーなんて\n思います^^ふふふへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくま先輩は\nお元気でしょうか...？気になります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんの耳は、\n嬉しくなると真っ赤になるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けへっっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメはみますか？\nみるなどんなん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり見てない。\nおすすめありますか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪に遊びに来たりする\n予定はないのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も握手会大阪でやらんよね><\nプライベートでは最近行ってないなあ。\n友達に会いたいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まできた制服や衣装で\n一番お気に入りなのはどれなのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンすき！\nマネキンのセーラー服もすき！\n制服は夏服がすきかな。\n3rdのも今回のもすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"荒ぶる確率高い\nメンバーは誰ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋でしょっちゅう奇声\nあげてるのはゆったん。\nでも、うん。\nみんな誰かしら荒ぶってるかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段のレッスンって、\nダンスレッスンの他は\nヴォーカルトレーニングや\n演技のレッスンとかもするの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期はよくやってたけど、\n最近はしてないかなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールのダンスで\n好きな振りってどこかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2番Aメロの振りかわいいよ！\n全握のミニライブ楽しみね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下で荒ぶる写メいいね\n誰が撮ったのかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりん照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV撮った監督さんって\n個人PV「ナイフ」撮った柳沢監督？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです！\n今回もお世話になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこのななみん新郎と\nまりかのツーショットは撮った？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"並んで撮ったよ！\nでも画像がスタッフさんの\nケータイああああ\nななみの耳出してるのすきなんです。\n玲香も綺麗でしたなあ。\nウェディングドレスっていいなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近毎日聴いてるのは\n空想委員会さんの\n波動砲ガールフレンドです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\nこの緑のぐるぐるした落書き見て、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あーまりかは苔をイメージして\nこの緑のぐるぐるしたの描いたんだな」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったあなたは完全にまりっ会です。\nえ、わかりにくい？え？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺私まりっ会だけど\n苔だとは思わなかった？\n芝生だと思った？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなあなた残念賞"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃじゃじゃーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はある撮影です。\n朝早いよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかり寝なきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/11/5187179/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}